WEBVTT

00:13.347 --> 00:14.814
How are you doing?

00:16.917 --> 00:19.181
You're like always,
Big Sister.

00:19.286 --> 00:21.379
I'm your only
blood relative too.

00:22.489 --> 00:24.889
I have
wonderful news today.

00:24.992 --> 00:28.257
Something very special
to tell you, Big Sister.

00:28.362 --> 00:32.423
Though I can't see the future
in dreams like you,

00:32.533 --> 00:36.469
I can eavesdrop over your dreams
as you cross them.

00:41.275 --> 00:45.006
I saw the dream about
two Divine Swords and two Kamuis.

00:47.181 --> 00:49.979
I finally realized
what that dream meant.

00:51.452 --> 00:54.353
That there is
more than one Kamui.

00:54.455 --> 00:56.013
The other Kamui...

00:56.123 --> 00:59.058
Yes, Kamui has a twin star.

00:59.159 --> 01:01.650
It looks like
I've found him.

01:01.762 --> 01:02.660
Kanoe!

01:04.231 --> 01:07.325
Two Kamuis
and their two futures.

01:07.434 --> 01:10.369
The other Kamui
will awaken very soon.

01:33.386 --> 01:37.220
Episode 11
Border

01:59.445 --> 02:00.935
Who?

02:01.047 --> 02:01.945
Who is it?

02:11.524 --> 02:12.422
Shirou!

03:10.917 --> 03:11.815
Why?

03:15.421 --> 03:17.116
Why are there two Shirous?

03:29.302 --> 03:30.200
Stop it!

03:32.872 --> 03:34.169
Big Brother...

03:34.273 --> 03:35.297
Are you all right?

03:35.408 --> 03:38.070
You've been moaning
for quite a while.

03:38.177 --> 03:39.474
A dream...

03:39.579 --> 03:40.477
A dream?

03:41.647 --> 03:42.705
A nightmare...

03:43.950 --> 03:46.510
You and Shirou...

03:48.654 --> 03:52.021
You and Shirou
were killing each other.

03:54.627 --> 03:58.393
But something like that
can't possibly happen...

03:58.498 --> 03:59.988
I'm sure it's just a dream.

04:00.099 --> 04:01.657
Of course.

04:01.768 --> 04:05.397
I'm sure you're just tired
after Father's funeral, right?

04:05.505 --> 04:06.904
That's probably why.

04:07.006 --> 04:10.032
If you rest quietly,
you'll be better in time.

04:10.143 --> 04:11.633
Yeah.

04:11.744 --> 04:15.441
Well, I'll be getting our meal
ready downstairs.

04:15.548 --> 04:17.413
I'll call you later.

04:17.517 --> 04:19.917
I'm sorry to trouble you,
Big Brother.

04:21.354 --> 04:23.948
Dummy,
don't hold anything back.

04:31.431 --> 04:32.762
That dream...

04:32.865 --> 04:33.923
Kotori, too?

04:42.041 --> 04:42.939
Kamui.

04:46.979 --> 04:48.207
How's Kotori?

04:48.314 --> 04:50.612
She was bothered
by her dreams again.

04:50.716 --> 04:52.411
It seems
she had a nightmare.

04:52.518 --> 04:53.985
A nightmare?

04:54.086 --> 04:59.490
She started being bothered
by dreams when our mother died.

04:59.592 --> 05:02.561
But it hasn't happened
the past year,

05:02.662 --> 05:04.357
so I was feeling at ease.

05:04.464 --> 05:05.692
I'm sorry.

05:05.798 --> 05:07.129
It's all my fault.

05:14.807 --> 05:18.243
We used to play here
often in the past.

05:18.344 --> 05:19.572
You remember, right?

05:20.980 --> 05:22.379
Father and Mother...

05:22.482 --> 05:26.077
...and Aunt Tohru
always watched over us.

05:28.187 --> 05:30.382
Everyone seemed
to have a good time.

05:34.861 --> 05:35.953
Kamui...

05:36.062 --> 05:38.087
Tell me something.

05:38.197 --> 05:43.260
Aunt Tohru left, taking you along
with her, right after Mother died.

05:43.369 --> 05:48.102
And right when you came back
six years later, Father died.

05:49.208 --> 05:52.177
Leaving behind a comment
that I'm your twin star...

05:52.278 --> 05:53.905
And...

05:54.013 --> 05:56.504
...I saw the same dream
that Kotori did.

05:56.616 --> 06:00.575
An ominous dream where you and I
are killing each other.

06:00.686 --> 06:02.551
This is no coincidence.

06:02.655 --> 06:04.623
Something is going on here.

06:04.724 --> 06:06.692
But I have no idea what.

06:07.827 --> 06:10.557
Kamui, if you
know something, tell me!

06:11.664 --> 06:14.155
What happened these six years?

06:16.502 --> 06:17.560
At this rate...

06:19.071 --> 06:21.631
...I won't even be able
to protect Kotori.

06:22.975 --> 06:24.704
Please, tell me, Kamui.

06:34.020 --> 06:36.250
Kamui, hurry over here!

06:36.355 --> 06:37.344
Kamui!

06:37.456 --> 06:38.923
Mother...

06:39.025 --> 06:41.289
Did Aunt Saya really die?

06:42.395 --> 06:43.293
It's true.

06:45.197 --> 06:48.257
Are Kotori and Fuma crying?

06:50.937 --> 06:54.464
I'm sure they are sad about it.

06:54.574 --> 06:58.374
That's why we should
leave without saying goodbye.

06:58.477 --> 07:01.469
I'm sure they'll be
even lonelier when you're gone.

07:02.715 --> 07:03.613
Yeah.

07:05.518 --> 07:06.746
Let's go.

07:06.852 --> 07:09.150
Will I ever see them again?

07:09.255 --> 07:11.450
Okinawa is far away, right?

07:11.557 --> 07:12.990
Will I never see them?

07:13.092 --> 07:16.619
No, I'm sure you
will see them again.

07:16.729 --> 07:17.096
A transfer student?

07:17.096 --> 07:18.297
Kamui Shirou
A transfer student?

07:18.297 --> 07:19.298
Kamui Shirou

07:19.298 --> 07:21.425
Kamui Shirou
Quiet.
Quiet down.

07:23.202 --> 07:26.365
This is Kamui Shirou,
transfered from Tokyo.

07:26.472 --> 07:28.064
Everyone,
be nice to him.

07:29.709 --> 07:31.836
I'm Kamui Shirou.

07:31.944 --> 07:33.036
Hello.

07:39.952 --> 07:42.420
H-Hey, Kamui.

07:42.521 --> 07:44.386
What are you doing out here?

07:46.459 --> 07:48.256
We were waiting for you.

07:53.532 --> 07:56.899
Do you really
have some crazy-ass power?

07:57.970 --> 07:59.494
I heard from him.

07:59.605 --> 08:02.768
You bent
the parallel bars at school?

08:02.875 --> 08:04.342
I don't believe it.

08:04.443 --> 08:07.469
It's true.
It was bent this far!

08:07.580 --> 08:09.639
Then try bending this.

08:10.850 --> 08:12.442
I can't do that.

08:12.551 --> 08:13.449
You can, too!

08:13.552 --> 08:14.917
You bent that bar...

08:15.021 --> 08:16.955
Did you trick me?

08:17.056 --> 08:19.115
It's true!
I swear it's true!

08:19.225 --> 08:20.749
Kamui, please do it!

08:20.860 --> 08:22.623
Come on, please!

08:22.728 --> 08:23.660
I can't.

08:23.763 --> 08:26.596
Why? Come on, just do it!

08:26.699 --> 08:28.166
I can't.

08:28.267 --> 08:29.666
My mother will be mad.

08:31.337 --> 08:32.804
You can't even do it.

08:35.241 --> 08:36.606
Stop!
That's cruel!

08:36.709 --> 08:37.607
Shut up!

08:38.878 --> 08:40.743
This is all
because you lied!

08:42.148 --> 08:43.809
What do you want,
damn it?

08:44.917 --> 08:48.216
A shrimp like him couldn't
possibly bend a steel bar!

08:56.796 --> 08:58.787
W-What the hell is he?

08:58.898 --> 08:59.796
H-He's...

09:01.901 --> 09:03.232
...a-a monster!

09:08.641 --> 09:10.973
Are you all right?
You're bleeding.

09:11.077 --> 09:12.305
Don't touch me!

09:16.582 --> 09:18.982
I-I'm fine...

09:34.200 --> 09:35.098
Kamui.

09:42.808 --> 09:46.972
I want to see
Kotori and Fuma...

09:54.153 --> 09:56.587
You can't see them just yet.

09:56.689 --> 09:58.589
You can't see them, Kamui.

09:58.691 --> 09:59.555
Why?

10:00.626 --> 10:03.459
Until you're much stronger...

10:03.562 --> 10:07.623
Until you're strong enough to live
on your own, even without me.

10:08.734 --> 10:10.964
Mother,
you're going to disappear?

10:11.070 --> 10:12.799
I don't want that
to happen!

10:14.507 --> 10:17.340
Kamui, do you have something
worth protecting?

10:17.443 --> 10:21.379
Someone you want to be happy,
even if you become unhappy?

10:22.481 --> 10:24.676
Kotori... and Fuma.

10:25.785 --> 10:26.809
I see...

10:26.919 --> 10:28.386
Then it will be all right.

10:29.488 --> 10:32.389
You won't choose
the wrong path.

10:32.491 --> 10:34.288
You're important to me, too.

10:34.393 --> 10:36.657
I want you to be happy, too.

10:38.764 --> 10:41.289
My destiny
has been preordained.

10:41.400 --> 10:42.298
Destiny?

10:43.402 --> 10:45.427
What's destiny?

10:45.538 --> 10:48.371
A future that has
already been decided.

10:48.474 --> 10:50.066
That's really strange!

10:50.176 --> 10:53.805
There's just no way the future
can already be decided!

10:54.914 --> 10:55.972
That's true...

10:57.283 --> 11:00.844
Maybe you will be able
to change the future.

11:03.055 --> 11:05.888
Because you are "Kamui."

11:07.193 --> 11:08.854
Become stronger, Kamui.

11:09.962 --> 11:13.489
So that you can
protect Kotori and Fuma.

11:13.599 --> 11:16.534
So that you can
protect your loved ones.

11:47.600 --> 11:48.498
What?

11:50.502 --> 11:51.901
You're in the way,
damn it!

12:01.380 --> 12:03.075
What's the meanin' of this?

12:03.182 --> 12:04.444
Ya wanna die?

12:04.550 --> 12:05.642
Messin' around with us.

12:05.751 --> 12:07.378
Who the hell are you?

12:07.486 --> 12:10.182
Kamui Shirou of Toyo Junior High.

12:10.289 --> 12:12.314
What's the meaning of this?

12:12.424 --> 12:16.019
They told me that you guys
took some money from them.

12:16.128 --> 12:17.026
So what?

12:18.197 --> 12:19.960
Oh, nothing.

12:20.065 --> 12:23.626
But I thought
I'd say a little hello.

12:23.736 --> 12:25.294
Interesting.

12:25.404 --> 12:27.201
I'll play with you, shrimp.

12:56.368 --> 13:01.772
Naha South Police Office

13:09.348 --> 13:10.781
Kamui.

13:10.883 --> 13:14.546
The powers you have been
given are special powers.

13:15.621 --> 13:20.081
You are the one who will decide
what that power is used for.

13:20.192 --> 13:25.027
But you should be fully aware that
it's not in order to pick fights.

13:26.632 --> 13:28.259
Right...

13:28.367 --> 13:29.425
...Kamui?

13:43.449 --> 13:45.076
What are you up to, Kamui?

13:45.184 --> 13:47.516
You haven't been
coming to school.

13:47.619 --> 13:49.382
You're lucky.

13:49.488 --> 13:53.390
My parents yap so much that
I can't ditch even if I wanted to.

13:53.492 --> 13:58.191
Besides, weird guys are
wandering around campus lately.

13:58.297 --> 14:01.926
Maybe more of those gang guys
are looking for you.

14:02.034 --> 14:03.729
Whatcha gonna do, Kamui?

14:05.037 --> 14:07.164
I'm tired of fighting already...

14:37.936 --> 14:39.335
Mother!

14:42.541 --> 14:43.667
Mother!

14:46.612 --> 14:47.670
What is this?

14:48.947 --> 14:51.211
Mother,
what are you doing?

14:51.316 --> 14:52.214
Run!

14:53.952 --> 14:55.613
I'm sorry, Kamui.

14:57.322 --> 14:59.153
This is my destiny.

14:59.258 --> 15:00.156
Mother!

15:01.827 --> 15:03.852
Go to Tokyo, Kamui.

15:04.963 --> 15:06.988
Your destiny awaits.

15:08.067 --> 15:09.898
Become stronger.

15:10.002 --> 15:13.028
So that you can protect
your loved ones.

15:13.138 --> 15:16.733
So that when you hold the Divine
Sword in your hands and fight...

15:16.842 --> 15:18.742
...you will not be lost.

15:20.245 --> 15:22.406
Become stronger, Kamui.

15:30.456 --> 15:31.514
Mother...

15:41.333 --> 15:42.459
Mother died.

15:43.802 --> 15:45.360
That was two months ago.

15:47.172 --> 15:49.163
Why did Aunt Tohru...?

15:49.274 --> 15:52.209
To rid all catastrophes
that will befall me.

15:52.311 --> 15:53.437
She took my place.

15:54.546 --> 15:57.913
I followed her last will
to return to Tokyo.

15:58.016 --> 16:01.315
I came to receive
the Divine Sword kept here.

16:01.420 --> 16:05.356
I was going to disappear as soon
as I got the Divine Sword.

16:05.457 --> 16:08.017
But that wasn't how things went.

16:08.127 --> 16:10.118
Someone stole
the Divine Sword,

16:10.229 --> 16:13.562
and I made Uncle Kyougo
go through so much pain.

16:13.665 --> 16:15.690
What is that
"Divine Sword"?

16:15.801 --> 16:21.205
A sword that is necessary
during the Final Battle...

16:21.306 --> 16:24.241
...between the
Dragons of Heaven and Earth.

16:24.343 --> 16:26.106
And my powers, too.

16:27.713 --> 16:29.840
That's all I know.

16:32.484 --> 16:33.974
What will you do now?

16:37.189 --> 16:40.317
If what's written
in this letter is true...

16:40.425 --> 16:42.450
Tokiko Magami?

16:42.561 --> 16:44.358
Mother's younger sister.

16:44.463 --> 16:47.398
I'll receive the Divine Sword
here from her tonight.

16:47.499 --> 16:49.694
Will that end everything?

16:50.802 --> 16:52.599
I'm not sure of that, either.

16:52.704 --> 16:56.299
But I don't want to involve
you guys any more.

16:56.408 --> 16:58.433
Neither you nor Kotori.

17:01.180 --> 17:02.078
I see.

17:03.815 --> 17:04.941
Kamui.

17:05.050 --> 17:08.110
You really kept that promise
we made so long ago.

17:09.221 --> 17:11.382
The promise that
you'd protect Kotori.

17:11.490 --> 17:14.220
I promised back then, too.

17:14.326 --> 17:18.194
That I would protect you
no matter what happens.

17:18.297 --> 17:21.289
Kamui, I want to keep
my promise, too.

17:27.372 --> 17:28.430
Fuma...

17:30.742 --> 17:35.236
We're finally able to go back
to how we used to be...

17:36.582 --> 17:39.244
If there's anything
you want, I'll do it.

17:40.352 --> 17:42.252
I'm sure Kotori
would say the same.

17:42.354 --> 17:45.084
So don't be hesitant with us.

17:45.190 --> 17:46.987
Got that, Kamui?

17:47.092 --> 17:48.753
All right.

17:48.860 --> 17:50.919
I'll promise you, Fuma.

17:56.735 --> 17:58.032
What's wrong, Kamui?

18:01.340 --> 18:03.205
Someone's there.

18:03.308 --> 18:04.536
Stay here.

18:04.643 --> 18:05.541
Kamui...

18:15.087 --> 18:15.985
Blood?

18:20.158 --> 18:21.056
Kamui!

18:26.198 --> 18:27.165
Tokiko!

18:27.266 --> 18:29.359
I'm sorry.

18:29.468 --> 18:31.265
They were on my tail.

18:32.638 --> 18:33.696
Are you all right?

18:33.805 --> 18:34.794
I'll call a doctor.

18:34.906 --> 18:36.498
There's no need for that.

18:37.609 --> 18:40.077
There's no time left.

18:40.178 --> 18:44.308
Kamui, I need to hand you
the Divine Sword.

18:44.416 --> 18:46.782
When we talked last...

18:46.885 --> 18:51.254
...I told you the other Divine Sword
has not yet appeared...

18:51.356 --> 18:52.618
...into this world, right?

18:52.724 --> 18:56.057
It's going to be born right now...

18:56.161 --> 18:58.095
...from my body.

18:58.196 --> 18:59.185
From your body?

18:59.298 --> 19:00.287
That's right.

19:00.399 --> 19:02.026
When the moon is full...

19:04.503 --> 19:06.801
It was like this six years ago.

19:07.906 --> 19:09.806
The stolen Divine Sword...

19:09.908 --> 19:12.843
...was supposed to be
born from my sister Tohru.

19:12.944 --> 19:15.572
But you were too young...

19:16.682 --> 19:19.150
...and couldn't
possibly live by yourself.

19:19.251 --> 19:22.778
So the one who volunteered
to take her place...

19:22.888 --> 19:26.051
...was Saya, the one
who wed into this shrine.

19:27.125 --> 19:28.956
Your mother.

19:29.061 --> 19:29.959
Mother did?

19:31.063 --> 19:33.623
The day the first sword
could be born...

19:33.732 --> 19:36.667
...was that one day six years ago.

19:36.768 --> 19:41.137
Saya gave birth to that
Divine Sword and died.

19:41.239 --> 19:42.263
Impossible...

19:42.374 --> 19:44.239
You'll see in a minute...

19:54.953 --> 19:55.851
Tokiko...

20:02.227 --> 20:03.489
Stop it!

20:03.595 --> 20:06.223
You'll believe me this time, right?

20:06.331 --> 20:08.231
My sister Tohru's death...

20:08.333 --> 20:09.459
Saya's death...

20:10.569 --> 20:12.059
It is all destiny.

20:13.171 --> 20:15.605
I am merely following it myself.

20:15.707 --> 20:17.470
- You can't!
- Hey!

20:17.576 --> 20:19.771
This is my destiny.

20:39.264 --> 20:42.700
Take this Divine Sword,
and until the Promised Day...

20:42.801 --> 20:46.066
...hide it in the center
of the pentagram.

20:46.171 --> 20:49.072
In the center of the pentagram.

20:49.174 --> 20:51.233
Farewell, Kamui.
